{"4675850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crownborne", "steam_appid": 4675850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4773210, 5109780], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULLY VOICED IN ENGLISH. Every line. Every character. Every scene.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One ordinary night on Earth, the light bends, and you wake face-down in a scorched field, in a kingdom that is losing a war it cannot afford to lose. One question: how much of yourself are you willing to show the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crownborne</strong> is a fantasy romance visual novel about a modern young man summoned into a dying realm, the ancient power sleeping inside him, and the four people who give him a reason to stand. The plot bends around who you choose to become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Four romances</strong> worth crossing a war for: a princess wanted only for her crown and starving to be seen as the girl underneath, a knight-commander who fights you at every turn until the day she'd rather fight at your side, a court mage who swore she'd never let anyone in, and a mercenary who calls you golden boy to keep her at arm's length. Whoever you end up beside, you fall for in earnest.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675850/extras/311f7c1efe47c1b4cf1e59e47696c711.avif?t=1786671283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675850/extras_big/311f7c1efe47c1b4cf1e59e47696c711.avif?t=1786671283 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FEATURE LIST</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced in English</strong>: every line, every character, even the narration</p></li><li><p c